Terminals unused in grammar

    FLOAT_LITERAL


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: recipe_declaration

    2 recipe_declaration: RECIPE IDENTIFIER LBRACE step_list RBRACE

    3 step_list: step_list step_declaration
    4          | step_declaration

    5 step_declaration: STEP INTEGER_LITERAL LBRACE action_list RBRACE

    6 if_statement: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE action_list RBRACE

    7 condition: IDENTIFIER EQ_OP IDENTIFIER
    8          | IDENTIFIER EQ_OP INTEGER_LITERAL
    9          | IDENTIFIER EQ_OP STRING_LITERAL

   10 assignment: SET IDENTIFIER ASSIGN IDENTIFIER
   11           | SET IDENTIFIER ASSIGN INTEGER_LITERAL
   12           | SET IDENTIFIER ASSIGN STRING_LITERAL

   13 action_list: action SEMICOLON
   14            | action_list action SEMICOLON

   15 action: GET IDENTIFIER
   16       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL G_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   17       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL L_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   18       | ADD IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL P_UNIT TO IDENTIFIER
   19       | ADD IDENTIFIER TO IDENTIFIER
   20       | COOK IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL MIN_UNIT
   21       | RETURN IDENTIFIER
   22       | BOIL IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER INTEGER_LITERAL MIN_UNIT
   23       | DRAIN IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER
   24       | MIX IDENTIFIER
   25       | SERVE IDENTIFIER
   26       | assignment
   27       | if_statement


